{"kind":"html","caption":"从只有空集开始，依次处理 1、2、3；每读到一个数字，就复制当前已有的全部子集，并把该数字加入每个副本。新副本与原集合合并后，子集数量依次从 1 变为 2、4、8。因为每个元素只在自己的轮次被加入一次，数组元素又互不相同，所以不会生成重复子集。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>子集生成过程</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.nums{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.num-cell{min-width:38px;width:auto;padding:4px 8px}\n.num{font-size:14px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.num-cell.done{border-color:#3794ff;color:#3794ff}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:12px}\n.step{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.count{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:11px}\n.sets{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px}\n.set-card{padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px;min-height:auto}\n.set-card.new{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.set-value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}\n.set-note{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px}\n.set-card.new .set-note{color:#dceeff}\n.rule{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:11px}\n.rule-box{flex:1;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;line-height:1.45}\n.arrow{color:#3794ff;font-size:14px}\n.legend{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.45}\n@media(max-width:520px){.sets{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>逐元素扩展幂集</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 <span class=\"mono\">nums = [1,2,3]</span>，蓝卡为本轮新增子集。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">待处理</div><div class=\"nums\" id=\"nums\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"status\"><span class=\"step\" id=\"stepText\"></span><span id=\"actionText\"></span><span class=\"count\">数量 <span class=\"mono\" id=\"countText\"></span></span></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">当前解集</div><div class=\"sets\" id=\"sets\"></div><div class=\"legend\" id=\"legend\"></div></section>\n<div class=\"rule panel\"><div class=\"rule-box\">保留旧子集</div><div class=\"arrow\">＋</div><div class=\"rule-box\">复制并加入当前数</div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\n(function () {\n  const values = [1, 2, 3];\n  const frames = [\n    { active: -1, sets: [[]], oldCount: 1, title: '初始化', action: '先放入空集，作为扩展起点。' },\n    { active: 0, sets: [[], [1]], oldCount: 1, title: '处理数字 1', action: '复制空集，并在副本中加入 1。' },\n    { active: 1, sets: [[], [1], [2], [1, 2]], oldCount: 2, title: '处理数字 2', action: '复制已有的 2 个子集，并在每个副本中加入 2。' },\n    { active: 2, sets: [[], [1], [2], [1, 2], [3], [1, 3], [2, 3], [1, 2, 3]], oldCount: 4, title: '处理数字 3', action: '复制已有的 4 个子集，并在每个副本中加入 3。' },\n    { active: 3, sets: [[], [1], [2], [1, 2], [3], [1, 3], [2, 3], [1, 2, 3]], oldCount: 8, title: '完成', action: '3 个元素各有“选”或“不选”两种状态，共得到 2³ = 8 个子集。' }\n  ];\n\n  const numsEl = document.getElementById('nums');\n  const setsEl = document.getElementById('sets');\n  const stepEl = document.getElementById('stepText');\n  const actionEl = document.getElementById('actionText');\n  const countEl = document.getElementById('countText');\n  const legendEl = document.getElementById('legend');\n\n  values.forEach(function (value, index) {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'num-cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"num\">' + value + '</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ' + index + '</div>';\n    numsEl.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n\n  function formatSet(set) {\n    return '[' + set.join(',') + ']';\n  }\n\n  function render(frameIndex) {\n    const frame = frames[frameIndex];\n    Array.from(numsEl.children).forEach(function (cell, index) {\n      cell.className = 'num-cell';\n      if (frame.active === index) cell.classList.add('active');\n      if (frame.active > index) cell.classList.add('done');\n    });\n\n    stepEl.textContent = frame.title;\n    actionEl.textContent = frame.action;\n    countEl.textContent = frame.sets.length;\n    setsEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n    frame.sets.forEach(function (set, index) {\n      const card = document.createElement('div');\n      const isNew = frame.active >= 0 && frame.active < values.length && index >= frame.oldCount;\n      card.className = 'set-card' + (isNew ? ' new' : '');\n      const note = isNew ? '本轮新增' : (frameIndex === 0 ? '初始子集' : '原有子集');\n      card.innerHTML = '<div class=\"set-value\">' + formatSet(set) + '</div><div class=\"set-note\">' + note + '</div>';\n      setsEl.appendChild(card);\n    });\n\n    if (frameIndex === 0) {\n      legendEl.textContent = '任何数组的幂集都包含空集。';\n    } else if (frameIndex < frames.length - 1) {\n      legendEl.textContent = '本轮开始前有 ' + frame.oldCount + ' 个子集，因此会新增 ' + frame.oldCount + ' 个，数量翻倍。';\n    } else {\n      legendEl.textContent = '最终结果：[ ], [1], [2], [1,2], [3], [1,3], [2,3], [1,2,3]。';\n    }\n  }\n\n  let current = 0;\n  render(current);\n  setInterval(function () {\n    current = (current + 1) % frames.length;\n    render(current);\n  }, 2300);\n})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
